OL,3,ANew mums 'left to get on with it' as
OL,4,AC-section numbers hit record high
OL,5,
OL,6,FLatest figures show 42% of babies in
OL,7,FWales were born by C-section in 2025,
OL,8,Fwith just over half of those operations
OL,9,Fbeing emergencies.
